Acceptance results:
1. Store/Blobs/Events: operation-scoped WAL/FULL SQLite, schema version1, compressed atomic content-addressed blobs, immutable signed hash-chain events. Roundtrip, corruption/torn DB, permanent dedupe, signature/chain/tamper rejection tested.
2. Registry: ULID record/session/role-class/location/mute/task metadata; revision/generation/layout-bound grace/undo; supervisor-owned deadline continues after logic exit, reconnect reconciles retained exit. Tests exercise deadline and same live process after undo.
3. Bus: supplied Tokio handle, bounded router; slash grammar; per-object streams; live-only inbox/output; durable named/ephemeral consumers, all start policies, pending redelivery, explicit acks, latest/gaps/no_responders. Supervisor/mux/swarm/doc/task producers and own-seat socket subscriptions wired; adapter state/hook sources require W2.3, with generic bus handle available.
4. Index: real FSEvents invalidation, YAML and annotated/piped wikilinks, durable SQLite mirror plus transactional outbox, five graph projections. Mux writes stamp and independently verified DSSE digest signatures; intent/completion signed before/after effect and daily JSONL projection. External anonymous edits do not gain invented author.
5. State IPC: bounded private capability+generation NDJSON Attach/Subscribe/Snapshot/Delta/Applied/GetHistory/Gap; cell/cursor/mode/palette/style metadata, atomic exact-baseline checks. Actual SIGKILL of separate logic process, supervisor socket reattach, same zsh child PID, exact viewport; no graceful-save assumption.
